      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is already possible.\n\nI'm not home right now, but here: You would select the user in the quick menu whom you wish to show/hide avatar for (like if you go to block them), and it has 3 options: Show avatar (all features), hide avatar (no features) and Use Safety Settings (according to their rank). Hope this helps.",
