  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-11-26T15:24:47.511Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I posted this idea a few months back but I think it got confused with the social menu’s block avatar settings. This is not what I’m trying illustrate. \nI was hoping that in the social menu there would be a button to individually select the avatars/players one wants to hide and unhide. I understand you can hide avatars in the security settings depending on parameters; however, this idea is taking it a step further by only selecting the avatars/players you want to hide and unhide. What I would like to imagine is that a player can hide all avatars in the security settings and in the social tab be able to individually select the avatars/players they personally would like to see. This feature would be great for extreme circumstances, such as playing with a poor wifi connection.",
